{'symbol': 'BRK-B', 'date': '2022-08-05 05:30:00', 'title': 'KATHY CONNELLY ADVANCES TO CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER AT BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY HOMESERVICES GEORGIA PROPERTIES', 'text': 'ROSWELL, GA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY HOMESERVICES GEORGIA PROPERTIES, ONE OF THE LARGEST AND MOST SUCCESSFUL REAL ESTATE ORGANIZATIONS IN THE COUNTRY, RECENTLY ANNOUNCED KATHY CONNELLY, FORMERLY GEORGIA PROPERTIES SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF RELOCATION AND CORPORATE SERVICES, IS NOW CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER AT THE AWARD-WINNING BROKERAGE. BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY HOMESERVICES GEORGIA PROPERTIES IS A FULL-SERVICE BROKERAGE WITH 29 OFFICE LOCATIONS THROUGHOUT GEORGIA AND MORE THAN 1,600 SALES'}